       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.         SGETRPT.
       AUTHOR.             CA YODER.
       DATE-WRITTEN.       NOVEMBER 1997.
       DATE-COMPILED.
      *INSTALLATION.       GOODYEAR TIRE & RUBBER CO.

      *D* REMARKS.
      *D*
      *D*   THIS PROGRAM RETRIEVES REPORT DISTRIBUTION INFO
      *D*   FROM MCFPCS6700 & MCFPCS6800.
      *D*
      *
      *C* CHANGES
      *C*

       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.

       CONFIGURATION SECTION.

       SOURCE-COMPUTER.          IBM-AS400.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER.          IBM-AS400.

       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT DRPTMAST-I
               ASSIGN         TO DATABASE-MCFLCS6701
               ORGANIZATION   IS INDEXED
               ACCESS MODE    IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY     IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                                 WITH DUPLICATES
               FILE STATUS    IS FILE-STATUS.

           SELECT DRPTDIST-I
               ASSIGN         TO DATABASE-MCFLCS6801
               ORGANIZATION   IS INDEXED
               ACCESS MODE    IS DYNAMIC
               RECORD KEY     IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                                 WITH DUPLICATES
               FILE STATUS    IS FILE-STATUS.

       DATA DIVISION.

       FILE SECTION.

       FD  DRPTMAST-I
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  DRPTMAST-I-REC.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF MCFLCS6701.

       FD  DRPTDIST-I
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD.
       01  DRPTDIST-I-REC.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF MCFLCS6801.

       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *                   B U F F E R S
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------

       COPY DRPTMAST      OF COPYLIB.

       COPY DRPTDIST      OF COPYLIB.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *          D A T A B A S E   S T A T U S   A R E A
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------

       01  FILE-STATUS.
           05  FILE-STATUS-1        PIC X.
           05  FILE-STATUS-2        PIC X.

       COPY DATAB    OF COPYLIB.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *               U T I L I T Y   A R E A
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------

       COPY TBLOWUP OF COPYLIB.

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *              L I N K A G E   S E C T I O N
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------

       LINKAGE SECTION.

       01  LINKAGE-PARMS.
           05  LINK-PGM          PIC X(8).
           05  LINK-ID           PIC X(4).
           05  LINK-SW           PIC X.
           05  LINK-KEY          PIC X(10).
           05  LINK-PRINTER      PIC X(2).

      *-----------------------------------------------------------------
      *          P R O C E D U R E   D I V I S I O N
      *-----------------------------------------------------------------

       PROCEDURE DIVISION  USING LINKAGE-PARMS.

       BEGIN SECTION.

       0-BEGIN.
           PERFORM 1-HSK.
           PERFORM 6-MAIN THRU 6-MAIN-X.
           PERFORM 2-EOJ.
           GOBACK.

       1-HSK.
           OPEN I-O       DRPTMAST-I
                          DRPTDIST-I.

       2-EOJ.
           CLOSE          DRPTMAST-I
                          DRPTDIST-I.

       6-MAIN.
           IF LINK-KEY > SPACES
               GO TO 6-GET-PRINTER.

           MOVE LINK-PGM TO RPTPROG OF DRPTMAST-I-REC.
           READ DRPTMAST-I INTO BUF-DRPTMAST
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS = "00"
               MOVE MST-RPT-ID        TO  LINK-ID
               MOVE MST-RPT-SWITCH    TO  LINK-SW
           ELSE
               MOVE "N"               TO  LINK-SW.

           GO TO 6-MAIN-X.

       6-GET-PRINTER.
           MOVE LINK-ID        TO  RPTIDENT OF DRPTDIST-I-REC.
           MOVE LINK-KEY       TO  RPTKEY OF DRPTDIST-I-REC.
           READ DRPTDIST-I INTO BUF-DRPTDIST
               INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS.
           IF FILE-STATUS = "00"
               MOVE DST-PRINTER-NUM   TO  LINK-PRINTER
           ELSE
               MOVE SPACES            TO  LINK-PRINTER.
      *---------- GET DEFAULT PRINTER IF DEPARTMENT NOT FOUND.
           IF LINK-PRINTER = SPACES
               MOVE LINK-ID    TO  RPTIDENT OF DRPTDIST-I-REC
               MOVE "DEFAULT"  TO  RPTKEY OF DRPTDIST-I-REC
               READ DRPTDIST-I INTO BUF-DRPTDIST
                   INVALID KEY MOVE FILE-STATUS TO FILE-STATUS
               END-READ
               IF FILE-STATUS = "00"
                   MOVE DST-PRINTER-NUM   TO  LINK-PRINTER.

       6-MAIN-X.
           EXIT.
